    ("discharge: a refusal cites a shipped rule at path:line",
     DSC, "del", "cites a shipped rule at `path:line`"),
    ("discharge: a user decision is decided, never queued",
     DSC, "del", "no longer a queueable category"),
    ("discharge: this run's own org is not a discharger either",
     DFR, "del", "never discharged by this run's own ORG"),
    ("discharge: deletes nothing — the sweep stays the only destructive act",
